<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Seagate EPS view trimmed.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Seagate EPS view trimmed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns has trimmed its estimate for Seagate Technology Inc's fiscal 1997 earnings per share (EPS) to $3.45 from $3.55, a source at the brokerage said Thursday.</p>
<p>-- The source said the cut reflected &quot;an aggressive pricing environment.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The estimate of $4.75 EPS for fiscal 1998 remained unchanged.</p>
<p>-- Bear Stearns kept its rating of buy for the Costa Mesa, Calif., disk drive maker.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company closed Wednesday at 42-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
